    "title": "CUDA logarithmic softmax is not normalized for a float64 width-513 input",
    "body": "For a CUDA float64 tensor of shape (5, 513), exponentiating torch.nn.functional logarithmic-softmax output along the width does not produce rows that sum to one. The result must satisfy the normalization contract for this tail shape without regressing ordinary CUDA softmax inputs.",
